{"unit_id":"FFFFFFcn__dsh-intent-translator#card-zh","repo":"FFFFFFcn/dsh-intent-translator","commit":"aa6a17ec5ceec508012221543f218b7e652b894e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Intent Translator 是面向 DSH Web 输入框的插件，在对话输入工具栏加入「译」按钮，打开可编辑的翻译对话框。它可将口语草稿整理成包含目标、背景、要求、约束和交付物的专业提示词，并给出原话与专业术语的对照及补全假设；也可切换为只查术语，返回专业说法、领域、解释和例句。用户可以复制结果，或主动将改写文本替换回输入框。插件通过 DSH 已配置的模型路由完成一次辅助调用，不创建会话。适合希望把模糊想法表达得更清楚、或想知道某个概念专业上如何称呼的用户；没有单独声明 API 密钥或固定外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:536-582","core.js:122-187","core.js:399-450","index.js:41-81"]}
{"unit_id":"FFFFFFcn__dsh-intent-translator#card-en","repo":"FFFFFFcn/dsh-intent-translator","commit":"aa6a17ec5ceec508012221543f218b7e652b894e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Intent Translator adds a button to the DSH Web composer. It turns informal drafts into structured prompts with terminology mappings and assumptions. A terms-only mode suggests professional terms and examples. Users can copy results or replace the draft. It uses DSH's configured model route.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:536-582","core.js:122-187","core.js:399-450","index.js:41-81"]}
