{"unit_id":"FFFFFFcn__dsh-intent-translator#feature-1","repo":"FFFFFFcn/dsh-intent-translator","commit":"aa6a17ec5ceec508012221543f218b7e652b894e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Intent Translator 的功能「口语草稿改写」：把输入的日常表达整理为结构化、可直接发送的提示词，并附上术语对照与关键假设。点击输入框工具栏的「译」按钮后提交草稿，结果可复制，也可主动替换输入框内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:536-560","core.js:122-148","core.js:399-450"]}
{"unit_id":"FFFFFFcn__dsh-intent-translator#feature-2","repo":"FFFFFFcn/dsh-intent-translator","commit":"aa6a17ec5ceec508012221543f218b7e652b894e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Intent Translator 的功能「只查专业术语」：输入模糊说法后选择只查术语模式，返回若干专业表达及其领域、通俗解释和例句；此模式只给术语建议，不改写整段草稿。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:377-386","core.js:150-173","core.js:315-340"]}
{"unit_id":"FFFFFFcn__dsh-intent-translator#caveat-1","repo":"FFFFFFcn/dsh-intent-translator","commit":"aa6a17ec5ceec508012221543f218b7e652b894e","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Intent Translator 使用前须知：提交的草稿会通过 DSH 当前配置的模型路由发送给所选模型提供方；该插件本身没有声明专用密钥配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:41-50","core.js:399-423"]}
